To set up options for a **Dropdown** component from a code list in Altinn Studio, you set the component’s **`optionsId`** to the code list ID, either in Altinn Studio or directly in the layout file. [2][3]

For example, if the code list ID is `countries`, the component can be configured like this: [1]

```json
{
  "id": "dropdown-component",
  "type": "Dropdown",
  "textResourceBindings": {
    "title": "Some title"
  },
  "dataModelBindings": {
    "simpleBinding": "some.field"
  },
  "optionsId": "countries"
}
```

If the code list is a **secured code list**, you should also set `"secure": true`, and the provider must implement `IInstanceAppOptionsProvider`. [1]

