To configure an app with multiple pages, you define the pages in a layout set and then control their order in the `Settings.json` file for that layout set. Layout pages are placed in the `layouts` folder, and each process task can have its own layout set. The order of the pages is set in the `pages.order` array. [1]

Example `layout-sets.json`:
```json
{
  "$schema": "https://altinncdn.no/toolkits/altinn-app-frontend/4/schemas/json/layout/layout-sets.schema.v1.json",
  "sets": [
    {
      "id": "form-a",
      "dataType": "schema_4222_160523_forms_212_20160523",
      "tasks": ["Task_1"]
    },
    {
      "id": "form-b",
      "dataType": "schema_3161_140411_forms_1549_11554",
      "tasks": ["Task_2"]
    }
  ]
}
```  
