To configure **layout sets** for an app with multiple pages, place the layout pages in the `layouts` folder for each layout set, and define which process task each layout set should be used for in `layout-sets.json`. The `id` is case sensitive and should match the folder name exactly. [1]

Example `layout-sets.json`: [1]

```json
{
  "$schema": "https://altinncdn.no/toolkits/altinn-app-frontend/4/schemas/json/layout/layout-sets.schema.v1.json",
  "sets": [
    {
      "id": "form-a",
      "dataType": "schema_4222_160523_forms_212_20160523",
      "tasks": ["Task_1"]
    },
    {
      "id": "form-b",
      "dataType": "schema_3161_140411_forms_1549_11554",
      "tasks": ["Task_2"]
    }
  ]
}
```

